<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>图片转换SVG工具</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f5f7fa;
    --panel: #ffffff;
    --panel-2: #f1f4f9;
    --border: #d9dfe8;
    --text: #1f2937;
    --text-dim: #5b6675;
    --accent: #2563eb;
    --accent-hover: #1d4ed8;
    --danger: #dc2626;
    --ok: #16a34a;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font: 14px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
  }
  .app { max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; }
  header h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; }
  header p { margin: 0 0 20px; color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 13px; }
  main { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 400px; gap: 20px; align-items: start; }
  .panel {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .toolbar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .toolbar.sub { margin-bottom: 14px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  button, .btn {
    appearance: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--panel-2);
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background .15s, border-color .15s, opacity .15s;
  }
  button:hover:not(:disabled), .btn:hover { background: #e6ebf3; border-color: #b9c3d1; }
  button:disabled { opacity: .4; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .btn.primary { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; font-weight: 500; }
  .btn.primary:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); }
  .btn.danger { color: var(--danger); }
  .btn.ok { background: var(--ok); border-color: var(--ok); color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
  .btn.ok:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); }
  .btn.sm { padding: 3px 9px; font-size: 12px; }
  .ctl { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 12px; }
  .ctl input[type=range] { width: 110px; accent-color: var(--accent); }
  .ctl input[type=color] { width: 34px; height: 28px; padding: 0; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--panel-2); cursor: pointer; }
  .ctl .val { min-width: 44px; font-family: ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; color: var(--text); }
  .dropzone {
    border: 1.5px dashed var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    transition: border-color .15s, background .15s;
  }
  .dropzone.over { border-color: var(--accent); background: rgba(37,99,235,.07); }
  .viewport {
    max-height: 70vh;
    overflow: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #fafbfd;
    padding: 8px;
  }
  .stage { position: relative; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; cursor: crosshair; }
  .stage img { display: block; max-width: none; user-select: none; -webkit-user-drag: none; }
  .curve-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; }
  .markers { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .marker {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 5px rgba(15,23,42,.45);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: auto;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .hint { margin: 10px 0 0; color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 12px; }
  .intro { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--text); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .hint ol { margin: 6px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  .hint li { margin: 3px 0; }
  .section-title { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
  .badge { color: var(--text-dim); font-weight: 400; font-size: 12px; }
  .line-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    background: var(--panel-2);
  }
  .line-card.current { border-color: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--accent) inset; }
  .line-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .swatch { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; flex: none; }
  .line-name { font-weight: 600; }
  .line-actions { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-left: auto; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 12px 0; }
  textarea {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 110px;
    resize: vertical;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px;
    color: var(--text);
    font: 12px/1.5 ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace;
  }
  textarea::placeholder { color: #98a2b3; }
  .svg-preview-box { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .svg-preview-box .badge { display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .svg-preview-box img { display: block; max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; background: #ffffff; }
  @media (max-width: 980px) { main { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
  <header>
    <h1>图片转换SVG工具</h1>
    <p class="intro">在图片上手动取点，自动生成平滑曲线并导出可编辑 SVG。支持逐线或合并导出、坐标导入导出；生成的 SVG 不含取点标记，可直接在矢量软件中继续编辑。<br>与自动矢量化不同，轮廓取舍完全由你掌控：尤其适合背景复杂、对比弱的图片，以及连续色调、柔边、碎纹理、极细线，或毛发、草、织物等高频纹理——自动算法容易误判的区域，可按需取点、逐线保留。</p>
    <div class="hint">
      <strong>操作步骤</strong>
      <ol>
        <li>选择图片 → 选择线条颜色 → 在原图上依次点击取点；点击圆点可删除该点。</li>
        <li>画多条线：点“新建一条线”，换色后继续取点。</li>
        <li>取点技巧：直线段间距可稀疏，曲线段建议密集。</li>
        <li>视图：滚动鼠标滚轮平移，Ctrl（Mac 为 ⌘）+ 滚轮缩放。</li>
        <li>导出：每条线单独生成 SVG，或多线合并生成一个；坐标可导出、再导入复用。</li>
        <li>也可先在原图上补画、修改后再载入本工具取点。</li>
      </ol>
      <p>粗细与线宽单位为原图像素；坐标采用笛卡尔系（原点：图片左下角，x 向右、y 向上）。</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div>
      <section class="panel">
        <h2 class="section-title">1. 画点连线</h2>
        <div class="toolbar">
          <label class="btn primary">选择图片<input type="file" id="fileInput" accept="image/*" hidden></label>
          <span class="ctl"><label for="lineColor">线条颜色</label><input type="color" id="lineColor" value="#ff3b30" disabled></span>
          <button id="newLineBtn" disabled>新建一条线</button>
          <button id="undoBtn" disabled>撤销上一个点</button>
          <button id="clearLineBtn" disabled>清空当前线</button>
          <button id="clearAllBtn" disabled>清空全部</button>
        </div>
        <div class="toolbar sub">
          <span class="ctl"><label for="pointSizeRange">点粗细</label><input type="range" id="pointSizeRange" min="2" max="60" value="12" disabled><span class="val" id="pointSizeVal">12 px</span></span>
          <span class="ctl"><label for="lineWidthRange">线宽</label><input type="range" id="lineWidthRange" min="1" max="30" value="4" disabled><span class="val" id="lineWidthVal">4 px</span></span>
          <span class="ctl"><label for="smoothRange">平滑度</label><input type="range" id="smoothRange" min="0" max="100" value="100" disabled><span class="val" id="smoothValue">100%</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="toolbar sub">
          <button id="zoomOutBtn" disabled>缩小 −</button>
          <span class="ctl"><span id="zoomLabel">100%</span></span>
          <button id="zoomInBtn" disabled>放大 ＋</button>
          <button id="zoomFitBtn" disabled>适应窗口</button>
          <button id="zoomNativeBtn" disabled>原始像素 1:1</button>
        </div>

        <div id="dropzone" class="dropzone">点击“选择图片”，或将图片文件拖放到这里</div>

        <div id="viewport" class="viewport" hidden>
          <div id="stage" class="stage">
            <img id="image" alt="待标注图片">
            <svg id="curveOverlay" class="curve-overlay"></svg>
            <div id="markers" class="markers"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <h2 class="section-title">从坐标生成SVG <span class="badge" id="coordStatus"></span></h2>
        <p class="hint" style="margin:0 0 10px">如果你想用其他专业软件画图，在这里导出坐标。<br>如果你已经有图的坐标，在下面导入数据即可生成SVG。</p>
        <div class="toolbar">
          <button id="exportCoordsBtn" disabled>导出当前坐标</button>
          <button id="loadCoordsBtn" class="btn primary" disabled>按坐标绘制</button>
          <button id="clearCoordsBtn" disabled>清空文本</button>
        </div>
        <div class="toolbar">
          <span class="ctl"><label for="canvasW">画布宽</label><input type="number" id="canvasW" min="1" value="800" style="width:80px"></span>
          <span class="ctl"><label for="canvasH">画布高</label><input type="number" id="canvasH" min="1" value="600" style="width:80px"></span>
          <span class="badge">未载入图片时按此尺寸生成 SVG</span>
        </div>
        <textarea id="coordText" spellcheck="false" placeholder="每行一个点：x,y&#10;空行分隔多条线；或用 # 线名 作为标题行&#10;示例：&#10;# 线1&#10;10,20&#10;30,40&#10;&#10;# 线2&#10;50,60&#10;70,80"></textarea>
        <p class="hint">坐标采用笛卡尔系（原点左下角，x 向右、y 向上）。“按坐标绘制”会用文本中的线条替换当前线条并直接生成 SVG。</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2 class="section-title">2. 生成SVG <span class="badge" id="currentHint">未选择</span></h2>
      <div id="lineList"></div>

      <div class="actions">
        <button id="genBtn" class="btn ok" disabled>生成各线 SVG</button>
        <button id="genOneBtn" disabled>生成单个合并 SVG</button>
        <button id="copyBtn" disabled>复制全部 SVG</button>
        <button id="downloadBtn" disabled>下载全部 SVG</button>
        <button id="downloadOneBtn" disabled>下载合并 SVG</button>
      </div>
      <div class="svg-preview-box">
        <span class="badge">SVG 渲染预览（每条线一个）</span>
        <div id="svgRender"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>

<script>
(function () {
  const fileInput = document.getElementById('fileInput');
  const dropzone = document.getElementById('dropzone');
  const viewport = document.getElementById('viewport');
  const stage = document.getElementById('stage');
  const image = document.getElementById('image');
  const overlay = document.getElementById('curveOverlay');
  const markers = document.getElementById('markers');
  const currentHint = document.getElementById('currentHint');
  const lineColor = document.getElementById('lineColor');
  const lineList = document.getElementById('lineList');
  const newLineBtn = document.getElementById('newLineBtn');
  const undoBtn = document.getElementById('undoBtn');
  const clearLineBtn = document.getElementById('clearLineBtn');
  const clearAllBtn = document.getElementById('clearAllBtn');
  const pointSizeRange = document.getElementById('pointSizeRange');
  const pointSizeVal = document.getElementById('pointSizeVal');
  const lineWidthRange = document.getElementById('lineWidthRange');
  const lineWidthVal = document.getElementById('lineWidthVal');
  const smoothRange = document.getElementById('smoothRange');
  const smoothValue = document.getElementById('smoothValue');
  const zoomOutBtn = document.getElementById('zoomOutBtn');
  const zoomInBtn = document.getElementById('zoomInBtn');
  const zoomFitBtn = document.getElementById('zoomFitBtn');
  const zoomNativeBtn = document.getElementById('zoomNativeBtn');
  const zoomLabel = document.getElementById('zoomLabel');
  const genBtn = document.getElementById('genBtn');
  const genOneBtn = document.getElementById('genOneBtn');
  const copyBtn = document.getElementById('copyBtn');
  const downloadBtn = document.getElementById('downloadBtn');
  const downloadOneBtn = document.getElementById('downloadOneBtn');
  const svgRender = document.getElementById('svgRender');
  const canvasW = document.getElementById('canvasW');
  const canvasH = document.getElementById('canvasH');
  const coordText = document.getElementById('coordText');
  const coordStatus = document.getElementById('coordStatus');
  const exportCoordsBtn = document.getElementById('exportCoordsBtn');
  const loadCoordsBtn = document.getElementById('loadCoordsBtn');
  const clearCoordsBtn = document.getElementById('clearCoordsBtn');

  const COLORS = ['#ff3b30', '#4f8cff', '#3ddc97', '#ffb020', '#c77dff', '#00c2d1', '#ff7ab2', '#a3e635'];
  const STORAGE_KEY = 'pic2svg_state_v1';
  let imageDataUrl = '';
  let saveTimer = null;
  let lines = [];
  let currentLineId = null;
  let nextLineId = 1;
  let imgName = 'image';
  let svgParts = [];
  let oneSvg = '';
  let svgCodeText = '';
  let baseW = 0;
  let zoom = 1;

  const W = () => image.naturalWidth || Number(canvasW.value) || 800;
  const H = () => image.naturalHeight || Number(canvasH.value) || 600;
  const pointR = () => Number(pointSizeRange.value) / 2;
  const lineW = () => Number(lineWidthRange.value);
  const tension = () => Number(smoothRange.value) / 100;
  const fmt = n => String(Number(n.toFixed(1)));

  function currentLine() {
    return lines.find(l => l.id === currentLineId) || null;
  }

  function invalidate() {
    svgParts = [];
    oneSvg = '';
    copyBtn.disabled = true;
    downloadBtn.disabled = true;
    svgCodeText = '';
    svgRender.innerHTML = '';
    scheduleSave();
  }

  function loadFile(file) {
    if (!file || !file.type.startsWith('image/')) return;
    imgName = file.name.replace(/\.[^.]+$/, '') || 'image';
    const reader = new FileReader();
    reader.onload = e => {
      imageDataUrl = e.target.result;
      image.onload = () => {
        lines = [];
        nextLineId = 1;
        currentLineId = null;
        invalidate();
        dropzone.hidden = true;
        viewport.hidden = false;
        overlay.setAttribute('viewBox', '0 0 ' + W() + ' ' + H());
        baseW = Math.min(W(), Math.max(240, viewport.clientWidth - 20));
        zoom = 1;
        applyZoom(false);

        const defaultR = Math.max(2, Math.min(60, Math.round(Math.max(W(), H()) * 0.024)));
        pointSizeRange.value = defaultR;
        pointSizeVal.textContent = defaultR + ' px';
        const defaultLW = Math.max(1, Math.min(30, Math.round(defaultR / 3)));
        lineWidthRange.value = defaultLW;
        lineWidthVal.textContent = defaultLW + ' px';

        [newLineBtn, undoBtn, clearLineBtn, clearAllBtn, lineColor, pointSizeRange, lineWidthRange, smoothRange,
         zoomOutBtn, zoomInBtn, zoomFitBtn, zoomNativeBtn].forEach(el => { el.disabled = false; });

        render();
        addLine();
      };
      image.src = e.target.result;
    };
    reader.readAsDataURL(file);
  }

  function saveState() {
    try {
      localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify({
        lines: lines,
        nextLineId: nextLineId,
        currentLineId: currentLineId,
        imgName: imgName,
        imageDataUrl: imageDataUrl,
        coordText: coordText.value,
        canvasW: canvasW.value,
        canvasH: canvasH.value,
        lineColor: lineColor.value,
        pointSize: pointSizeRange.value,
        lineWidth: lineWidthRange.value,
        smooth: smoothRange.value
      }));
    } catch (err) {
      // 图片 dataURL 过大或隐私模式下写入失败：降级为只存坐标数据
      try {
        localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify({
          lines: lines,
          nextLineId: nextLineId,
          currentLineId: currentLineId,
          imgName: imgName,
          imageDataUrl: '',
          coordText: coordText.value,
          canvasW: canvasW.value,
          canvasH: canvasH.value,
          lineColor: lineColor.value,
          pointSize: pointSizeRange.value,
          lineWidth: lineWidthRange.value,
          smooth: smoothRange.value
        }));
      } catch (ignored) { /* 无法持久化，静默跳过 */ }
    }
  }

  function scheduleSave() {
    clearTimeout(saveTimer);
    saveTimer = setTimeout(saveState, 400);
  }

  function applyZoom(doRender) {
    if (!W()) return;
    image.style.width = Math.round(baseW * zoom) + 'px';
    zoomLabel.textContent = Math.round(zoom * 100) + '%';
    zoomOutBtn.disabled = zoom <= 0.25;
    zoomInBtn.disabled = zoom >= 8;
    if (doRender !== false) render();
  }

  function setZoom(z) {
    zoom = Math.min(8, Math.max(0.25, z));
    applyZoom(true);
  }

  function fitZoom() {
    baseW = Math.min(W(), Math.max(240, viewport.clientWidth - 20));
    setZoom(1);
  }

  function addLine() {
    if (viewport.hidden) return;
    const line = {
      id: nextLineId++,
      color: lineColor.value,
      points: []
    };
    lines.push(line);
    currentLineId = line.id;
    invalidate();
    render();
  }

  function selectLine(id) {
    currentLineId = id;
    const l = lines.find(x => x.id === id);
    if (l) lineColor.value = l.color;
    render();
  }

  function deleteLine(id) {
    lines = lines.filter(l => l.id !== id);
    if (currentLineId === id) currentLineId = lines.length ? lines[lines.length - 1].id : null;
    invalidate();
    render();
  }

  fileInput.addEventListener('change', e => loadFile(e.target.files[0]));

  ['dragenter', 'dragover'].forEach(type => dropzone.addEventListener(type, e => {
    e.preventDefault();
    dropzone.classList.add('over');
  }));
  ['dragleave', 'drop'].forEach(type => dropzone.addEventListener(type, e => {
    e.preventDefault();
    dropzone.classList.remove('over');
  }));
  dropzone.addEventListener('drop', e => loadFile(e.dataTransfer.files[0]));

  stage.addEventListener('click', e => {
    if (e.target.classList.contains('marker')) return;
    const line = currentLine();
    if (!line) return;
    const rect = image.getBoundingClientRect();
    const sx = (e.clientX - rect.left) * (W() / rect.width);
    const sy = (e.clientY - rect.top) * (H() / rect.height);
    line.points.push({
      x: Math.round(sx),
      y: Math.round(H() - sy)
    });
    invalidate();
    render();
  });

  function removePoint(lineId, index) {
    const line = lines.find(l => l.id === lineId);
    if (!line) return;
    line.points.splice(index, 1);
    invalidate();
    render();
  }

  newLineBtn.addEventListener('click', addLine);
  undoBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const line = currentLine();
    if (line && line.points.length) removePoint(line.id, line.points.length - 1);
  });
  clearLineBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const line = currentLine();
    if (!line) return;
    line.points = [];
    invalidate();
    render();
  });
  clearAllBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    lines = [];
    currentLineId = null;
    invalidate();
    render();
  });

  pointSizeRange.addEventListener('input', () => {
    pointSizeVal.textContent = pointSizeRange.value + ' px';
    invalidate();
    render();
  });
  lineWidthRange.addEventListener('input', () => {
    lineWidthVal.textContent = lineWidthRange.value + ' px';
    invalidate();
    render();
  });
  lineColor.addEventListener('input', () => {
    const l = currentLine();
    if (!l) return;
    l.color = lineColor.value;
    invalidate();
    render();
  });

  smoothRange.addEventListener('input', () => {
    smoothValue.textContent = smoothRange.value + '%';
    invalidate();
    render();
  });

  zoomInBtn.addEventListener('click', () => setZoom(zoom * 1.25));
  zoomOutBtn.addEventListener('click', () => setZoom(zoom / 1.25));
  zoomFitBtn.addEventListener('click', fitZoom);
  zoomNativeBtn.addEventListener('click', () => setZoom(W() / baseW));
  viewport.addEventListener('wheel', e => {
    e.preventDefault();
    if (e.ctrlKey || e.metaKey) {
      setZoom(zoom * (e.deltaY < 0 ? 1.1 : 1 / 1.1));
    } else {
      viewport.scrollLeft += e.deltaX;
      viewport.scrollTop += e.deltaY;
    }
  }, { passive: false });

  function pathD(points, t, useScreen) {
    if (!points.length) return '';
    const conv = p => useScreen ? { x: p.x, y: H() - p.y } : { x: p.x, y: p.y };
    const p = points.map(conv);
    let d = 'M ' + fmt(p[0].x) + ' ' + fmt(p[0].y);
    if (p.length === 1) return d;
    for (let i = 0; i < p.length - 1; i++) {
      const p0 = p[i - 1] || p[i];
      const p1 = p[i];
      const p2 = p[i + 1];
      const p3 = p[i + 2] || p[i + 1];
      const c1x = p1.x + (p2.x - p0.x) / 6 * t;
      const c1y = p1.y + (p2.y - p0.y) / 6 * t;
      const c2x = p2.x - (p3.x - p1.x) / 6 * t;
      const c2y = p2.y - (p3.y - p1.y) / 6 * t;
      d += ' C ' + fmt(c1x) + ' ' + fmt(c1y) + ' ' + fmt(c2x) + ' ' + fmt(c2y) + ' ' + fmt(p2.x) + ' ' + fmt(p2.y);
    }
    return d;
  }

  function render() {
    const hasImg = !viewport.hidden;
    const line = currentLine();
    const hasPoints = lines.some(l => l.points.length > 0);
    const totalPoints = lines.reduce((n, l) => n + l.points.length, 0);

    newLineBtn.disabled = !hasImg;
    undoBtn.disabled = !line || !line.points.length;
    clearLineBtn.disabled = !line || !line.points.length;
    clearAllBtn.disabled = !lines.length;
    genBtn.disabled = !hasPoints;
    genOneBtn.disabled = !hasPoints;
    copyBtn.disabled = !svgParts.length;
    downloadBtn.disabled = !svgParts.length;
    downloadOneBtn.disabled = !oneSvg;
    exportCoordsBtn.disabled = !hasPoints;
    loadCoordsBtn.disabled = !coordText.value.trim();
    clearCoordsBtn.disabled = !coordText.value;

    currentHint.textContent = line ? '当前：线 ' + line.id + '（共 ' + totalPoints + ' 点）' : '未选择';

    markers.innerHTML = '';
    lineList.innerHTML = '';

    overlay.innerHTML = lines.map(l => {
      if (!l.points.length) return '';
      return '<path d="' + pathD(l.points, tension(), true) + '" fill="none" stroke="' + l.color + '" stroke-width="' + lineW() + '" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/>';
    }).join('');

    const rect = image.getBoundingClientRect();
    const scaleX = rect.width / (W() || 1);
    const scaleY = rect.height / (H() || 1);
    const dotPx = Math.max(12, Number(pointSizeRange.value) * scaleX);
    const dotFont = Math.max(9, Math.min(16, dotPx * 0.55));

    lines.forEach(l => {
      const card = document.createElement('div');
      card.className = 'line-card' + (l.id === currentLineId ? ' current' : '');
      const head = document.createElement('div');
      head.className = 'line-head';
      head.innerHTML =
        '<span class="swatch" style="background:' + l.color + '"></span>' +
        '<span class="line-name">线 ' + l.id + '</span>' +
        '<span class="badge">' + l.points.length + ' 个点</span>';
      const acts = document.createElement('div');
      acts.className = 'line-actions';
      const select = document.createElement('button');
      select.className = 'btn sm';
      select.textContent = l.id === currentLineId ? '绘制中' : '切换为当前';
      select.disabled = l.id === currentLineId;
      select.addEventListener('click', () => selectLine(l.id));
      const one = document.createElement('button');
      one.className = 'btn sm';
      one.textContent = '生成该线 SVG';
      one.disabled = !l.points.length;
      one.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const svg = buildSvg(l);
        svgCodeText = svg;
        svgParts = [{ svg: svg, lineId: l.id }];
        copyBtn.disabled = false;
        downloadBtn.disabled = false;
        renderSvgPreviews();
      });
      const oneDl = document.createElement('button');
      oneDl.className = 'btn sm';
      oneDl.textContent = '下载该线 SVG';
      oneDl.disabled = !l.points.length;
      oneDl.addEventListener('click', () => downloadSvg([buildSvg(l, false)], l.id));
      const del = document.createElement('button');
      del.className = 'btn sm danger';
      del.textContent = '删除线';
      del.addEventListener('click', () => deleteLine(l.id));
      acts.append(select, one, oneDl, del);
      head.appendChild(acts);
      card.appendChild(head);
      lineList.appendChild(card);

      l.points.forEach((p, i) => {
        const dot = document.createElement('div');
        dot.className = 'marker';
        dot.textContent = i + 1;
        dot.style.width = dotPx + 'px';
        dot.style.height = dotPx + 'px';
        dot.style.margin = (-dotPx / 2) + 'px 0 0 ' + (-dotPx / 2) + 'px';
        dot.style.lineHeight = (dotPx - 4) + 'px';
        dot.style.fontSize = dotFont + 'px';
        dot.style.left = (p.x * scaleX) + 'px';
        dot.style.top = ((H() - p.y) * scaleY) + 'px';
        dot.style.background = l.color;
        dot.title = '线 ' + l.id + ' 点 ' + (i + 1) + '（' + p.x + ', ' + p.y + '），点击删除';
        dot.addEventListener('click', ev => {
          ev.stopPropagation();
          removePoint(l.id, i);
        });
        markers.appendChild(dot);
      });
    });
  }

  let previewUrls = [];
  function renderSvgPreviews() {
    previewUrls.forEach(u => URL.revokeObjectURL(u));
    previewUrls = [];
    svgRender.innerHTML = '';
    const items = svgParts.length
      ? svgParts.map(p => ({ svg: p.svg, cap: '线 ' + p.lineId + ' · ' + imgName + '_line' + p.lineId + '.svg' }))
      : (oneSvg ? [{ svg: oneSvg, cap: '合并 SVG · ' + imgName + '_all_lines.svg' }] : []);
    items.forEach(item => {
      const wrap = document.createElement('div');
      const cap = document.createElement('span');
      cap.className = 'badge';
      cap.textContent = item.cap;
      const img = document.createElement('img');
      const url = URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([item.svg], { type: 'image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8' }));
      previewUrls.push(url);
      img.src = url;
      img.alt = item.cap;
      wrap.appendChild(cap);
      wrap.appendChild(img);
      svgRender.appendChild(wrap);
    });
    if (!items.length) svgRender.innerHTML = '';
  }

  function lineElements(line, indent, includePoints) {
    const pts = line.points;
    const r = pointR();
    const stroke = lineW();
    const out = [];
    const pre = indent || '';
    out.push(pre + '<g id="line-' + line.id + '" data-line-id="' + line.id + '" data-color="' + line.color + '">');
    out.push(pre + '  <path d="' + pathD(pts, tension(), false) + '" fill="none" stroke="' + line.color + '" stroke-width="' + stroke + '" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/>');
    if (includePoints !== false) {
      pts.forEach(p => {
        out.push(pre + '  <circle cx="' + p.x + '" cy="' + p.y + '" r="' + r + '" fill="' + line.color + '" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="' + Math.max(1, Math.round(r * 0.22)) + '" data-x="' + p.x + '" data-y="' + p.y + '"/>');
      });
    }
    out.push(pre + '</g>');
    return out;
  }

  function buildSvg(line, includePoints) {
    const w = W();
    const h = H();
    const parts = [];
    parts.push('<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="' + w + '" height="' + h + '" viewBox="0 0 ' + w + ' ' + h + '" data-line-id="' + line.id + '" data-coordinate-system="cartesian" data-origin="bottom-left" data-smooth="' + tension() + '">');
    parts.push('  <desc>线 ' + line.id + '，共 ' + line.points.length + ' 个点。笛卡尔坐标系：原点左下角，x 向右为正，y 向上为正；平滑曲线为 Catmull-Rom 转三次贝塞尔。</desc>');
    parts.push('  <g transform="translate(0,' + h + ') scale(1,-1)">');
    parts.push.apply(parts, lineElements(line, '    ', includePoints));
    parts.push('  </g>');
    parts.push('</svg>');
    return parts.join('\n');
  }

  function buildOneSvg(includePoints) {
    const w = W();
    const h = H();
    const withPoints = lines.filter(l => l.points.length);
    const parts = [];
    parts.push('<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="' + w + '" height="' + h + '" viewBox="0 0 ' + w + ' ' + h + '" data-coordinate-system="cartesian" data-origin="bottom-left" data-smooth="' + tension() + '" data-line-count="' + withPoints.length + '">');
    parts.push('  <desc>共 ' + withPoints.length + ' 条线。笛卡尔坐标系：原点左下角，x 向右为正，y 向上为正；平滑曲线为 Catmull-Rom 转三次贝塞尔。</desc>');
    parts.push('  <g transform="translate(0,' + h + ') scale(1,-1)">');
    withPoints.forEach(l => { parts.push.apply(parts, lineElements(l, '    ', includePoints)); });
    parts.push('  </g>');
    parts.push('</svg>');
    return parts.join('\n');
  }

  function downloadSvg(svgs, suffix) {
    svgs.forEach((svg, i) => {
      const blob = new Blob([svg], { type: 'image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8' });
      const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
      const a = document.createElement('a');
      a.href = url;
      a.download = imgName + '_' + (suffix ? 'line' + suffix : 'line' + (i + 1)) + '.svg';
      document.body.appendChild(a);
      a.click();
      a.remove();
      setTimeout(() => URL.revokeObjectURL(url), 1000);
    });
  }

  function generateAll() {
    const withPoints = lines.filter(l => l.points.length);
    svgParts = withPoints.map(l => ({ svg: buildSvg(l), lineId: l.id }));
    oneSvg = withPoints.length ? buildOneSvg() : '';
    svgCodeText = svgParts
      .map(p => '<!-- ===== 线 ' + p.lineId + ' · ' + imgName + '_line' + p.lineId + '.svg ===== -->\n' + p.svg)
      .concat(oneSvg ? ['<!-- ===== 合并 SVG · ' + imgName + '_all_lines.svg ===== -->\n' + oneSvg] : [])
      .join('\n\n');
    copyBtn.disabled = !svgParts.length;
    downloadBtn.disabled = !svgParts.length;
    downloadOneBtn.disabled = !oneSvg;
    renderSvgPreviews();
  }

  genBtn.addEventListener('click', generateAll);

  genOneBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    oneSvg = lines.some(l => l.points.length) ? buildOneSvg() : '';
    svgCodeText = oneSvg;
    svgParts = [];
    copyBtn.disabled = !oneSvg;
    downloadBtn.disabled = true;
    downloadOneBtn.disabled = !oneSvg;
    renderSvgPreviews();
  });

  copyBtn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    if (!svgParts.length) return;
    const text = svgCodeText;
    try {
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
    } catch (err) {
      const ta = document.createElement('textarea');
      ta.value = text;
      document.body.appendChild(ta);
      ta.select();
      document.execCommand('copy');
      ta.remove();
    }
    copyBtn.textContent = '已复制';
    setTimeout(() => { copyBtn.textContent = '复制全部 SVG'; }, 1500);
  });

  downloadBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (!svgParts.length) return;
    svgParts.forEach(p => {
      const line = lines.find(l => l.id === p.lineId);
      if (line) downloadSvg([buildSvg(line, false)], line.id);
    });
  });

  downloadOneBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (!oneSvg) return;
    const blob = new Blob([buildOneSvg(false)], { type: 'image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8' });
    const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
    const a = document.createElement('a');
    a.href = url;
    a.download = imgName + '_all_lines.svg';
    document.body.appendChild(a);
    a.click();
    a.remove();
    setTimeout(() => URL.revokeObjectURL(url), 1000);
  });

  function exportCoords() {
    const withPoints = lines.filter(l => l.points.length);
    if (!withPoints.length) return;
    coordText.value = withPoints.map(l =>
      '# 线' + l.id + '\n' + l.points.map(p => p.x + ',' + p.y).join('\n')
    ).join('\n\n');
    coordStatus.textContent = '已导出 ' + withPoints.length + ' 条线';
    loadCoordsBtn.disabled = !coordText.value.trim();
    clearCoordsBtn.disabled = false;
  }

  function parseCoords(text) {
    const result = [];
    let cur = null;
    text.split(/\r?\n/).forEach(raw => {
      const line = raw.trim();
      if (!line || line.startsWith('#') || line.startsWith('//')) {
        if (!line) { cur = null; return; }
        if (line.startsWith('#') || line.startsWith('//')) {
          const name = line.replace(/^[#/]+\s*/, '').trim();
          cur = { name: name || '线' + (result.length + 1), points: [] };
          result.push(cur);
          return;
        }
      }
      const nums = line.match(/-?\d+(\.\d+)?/g);
      if (!nums || nums.length < 2) return;
      if (!cur) { cur = { name: '线' + (result.length + 1), points: [] }; result.push(cur); }
      for (let i = 0; i + 1 < nums.length; i += 2) {
        cur.points.push({ x: Number(nums[i]), y: Number(nums[i + 1]) });
      }
    });
    return result.filter(l => l.points.length);
  }

  function loadCoords() {
    const parsed = parseCoords(coordText.value);
    if (!parsed.length) {
      coordStatus.textContent = '未解析到有效坐标';
      return;
    }
    lines = parsed.map((l, i) => ({
      id: i + 1,
      name: l.name,
      color: COLORS[i % COLORS.length],
      points: l.points
    }));
    nextLineId = lines.length + 1;
    currentLineId = lines.length ? lines[0].id : null;
    invalidate();
    if (viewport.hidden) {
      const maxX = Math.max.apply(null, parsed.flatMap(l => l.points.map(p => p.x)));
      const maxY = Math.max.apply(null, parsed.flatMap(l => l.points.map(p => p.y)));
      canvasW.value = Math.max(1, Math.ceil(maxX) + 40);
      canvasH.value = Math.max(1, Math.ceil(maxY) + 40);
      [pointSizeRange, lineWidthRange, smoothRange].forEach(el => { el.disabled = false; });
      pointSizeRange.value = 12; pointSizeVal.textContent = '12 px';
      lineWidthRange.value = 4; lineWidthVal.textContent = '4 px';
    }
    render();
    genBtn.click();
    coordStatus.textContent = '已绘制 ' + lines.length + ' 条线 / ' + lines.reduce((n, l) => n + l.points.length, 0) + ' 点';
  }

  exportCoordsBtn.addEventListener('click', exportCoords);
  loadCoordsBtn.addEventListener('click', loadCoords);
  clearCoordsBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    coordText.value = '';
    coordStatus.textContent = '';
    loadCoordsBtn.disabled = true;
    clearCoordsBtn.disabled = true;
  });
  coordText.addEventListener('input', () => {
    coordStatus.textContent = '文本已修改';
    loadCoordsBtn.disabled = !coordText.value.trim() || viewport.hidden;
    clearCoordsBtn.disabled = !coordText.value;
    scheduleSave();
  });
  [canvasW, canvasH].forEach(el => el.addEventListener('change', scheduleSave));

  function restoreState() {
    let raw;
    try { raw = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY); } catch (err) { return; }
    if (!raw) return;
    let st;
    try { st = JSON.parse(raw); } catch (err) { return; }
    if (!st || !Array.isArray(st.lines)) return;

    lines = st.lines;
    nextLineId = st.nextLineId || 1;
    currentLineId = st.currentLineId || null;
    imgName = st.imgName || 'image';
    if (st.canvasW) canvasW.value = st.canvasW;
    if (st.canvasH) canvasH.value = st.canvasH;
    coordText.value = st.coordText || '';
    if (st.lineColor) lineColor.value = st.lineColor;
    if (st.pointSize) pointSizeRange.value = st.pointSize;
    if (st.lineWidth) lineWidthRange.value = st.lineWidth;
    if (st.smooth) smoothRange.value = st.smooth;
    pointSizeVal.textContent = pointSizeRange.value + ' px';
    lineWidthVal.textContent = lineWidthRange.value + ' px';
    smoothValue.textContent = smoothRange.value + '%';

    const enableControls = () => {
      [newLineBtn, undoBtn, clearLineBtn, clearAllBtn, lineColor, pointSizeRange, lineWidthRange, smoothRange,
       zoomOutBtn, zoomInBtn, zoomFitBtn, zoomNativeBtn].forEach(el => { el.disabled = false; });
    };

    if (st.imageDataUrl) {
      imageDataUrl = st.imageDataUrl;
      image.onload = () => {
        dropzone.hidden = true;
        viewport.hidden = false;
        overlay.setAttribute('viewBox', '0 0 ' + W() + ' ' + H());
        baseW = Math.min(W(), Math.max(240, viewport.clientWidth - 20));
        zoom = 1;
        applyZoom(false);
        enableControls();
        render();
      };
      image.src = st.imageDataUrl;
    } else {
      // 未保存图片（降级）：线条无法定位，仅恢复坐标文本，等待“按坐标绘制”
      lines = [];
      currentLineId = null;
      [pointSizeRange, lineWidthRange, smoothRange].forEach(el => { el.disabled = false; });
      render();
    }
  }

  window.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (!viewport.hidden) fitZoom(); });
  restoreState();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
